# Docker network notes

Wt is network?
=============
	Ø It means to establish a communication between servers, people or machines.

Why Docker network?
==================

Wt is Docker network?
===================

	Ø Docker network has 3 types

	1. Bridge network  --> containers will get ip add and it is for prod use
	2. Host network  --> containers will not get ip add and it is for test purpose
	3. None network --> containers completely will be in isolated env and there is no internet access to the containers and it is used for databases to keep secure data.
